Z||000008||rogergarrison||03-22-2001||05:51 AM||||I saw about it being taken from an email. Just trying to discourage anyone from trying it. Just having a blown engine would be hard to prove, but bringing it back with a blown tranny, bald tires, etc would be way beyond coincedence. Dont think it would be hard to convince a judge. Corps have lawyers on retainers, so it wouldnt cost them anything to sue you.||||reg||1
